{"id":4070,"date":"2025-03-20T06:04:01","date_gmt":"2025-03-20T00:34:01","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/?p=4070"},"modified":"2025-03-20T06:04:01","modified_gmt":"2025-03-20T00:34:01","slug":"tmj-specialists-in-mumbai","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/tmj-specialists-in-mumbai\/","title":{"rendered":"6 Best TMJ Specialists in Mumbai For TMD Treatment"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Hey Mumbai! Looking for the best TMJ specialist in Mumbai? Then your search ends here with Dr. Dhivya Dilipkumar. She is India\u2019s top TMJ specialist with 15+ years of rich industry experience. Book a consultation with her by calling her at <a href=\"tel:+919884520520\">9884 520 520<\/a> and start your journey towards betterment.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">TMJ (Temporomandibular Joint) Disorders can be painful, unbearable, and outright discomforting. So finding the right TMJ specialist to help you out in this journey is crucial to help you improve your jaw movement. Mumbai, the dream city, is the central hub in India for almost everything. And the medical industry is no different. Mumbai houses some of the best medical professionals you can find for your TMJ needs of every kind.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether you are looking for a comprehensive treatment plan, diagnosis, consultation, or just a second opinion, you will find a range of specialists to suit your needs. But first, let us understand TMJ disorders in a better way.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What are TMJ Disorders?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">TMJ (temporomandibular joint) disorders are issues involving your temporomandibular joint. These joints are the hinges connecting your lower jaw to your skull and are located in front of each ear. TMJ disorders can cause pain and problems in your jaw and sometimes even restrict its movements. Some of the most common symptoms of TMJ Disorders include:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Pain or tenderness in the jaw<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pain around the ear<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Chewing difficulty<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Aching facial pain<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Difficulty in opening or closing mouth due to locking of the joint<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why do TMJ Disorders occur?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Some of the reasons why TMJ Disorders occur are:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Arthritis<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Joint erosion<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Jaw problems at birth<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Physical trauma or injury to the jaw joint<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Excessive teeth grinding, chewing, or nail biting due to anxiety<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Choose the Right TMJ Specialist?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your first step towards treating your TMJ disorder can make or break your journey. Hence it is very crucial to make sure you choose the right TMJ specialist. Here is a quick checklist to help you make the right decision.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>TMJ Disorder can vary and come in many forms. So it is crucial for you to understand the different specialists and go for the right <a href=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/tmj-specialists-in-india\/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/tmj-specialists-in-india\/\">TMJ specialist in India<\/a>.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Look for the experience and expertise of the professional in the field of TMJ, and seek someone with extensive experience and specific training in treating TMJ disorders.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Check for the right credentials which include the practice license and other important certifications required for treating TMJ disorders.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ask for a recommendation from someone who has already undergone TMJ treatment or check for feedback on Google and other medical websites.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Check the insurance policies, consultation fees, and other costs involved. As these can vary from doctor to doctor.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>As this is a long process, ensure the communication and comfort level is seamless with the medical professional.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Check for location and easy accessibility, and if needed, check for the possibility of online consultation with your preferred specialist.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>All in all, take all things into consideration and make the right choice of expert to begin with.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">List of the 6 Best TMJ Specialists in Mumbai<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Find the top 6 TMJ specialists in Mumbai renowned for their expertise in TMD treatment. From advanced diagnostics to personalized care, find the perfect solution for your TMJ issues with our curated list of leading specialists.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">01. Dr. Dhivya Dilipkumar<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/tmj-specialist-in-mumbai-1024x576.png\" alt=\"tmj specialist in mumbai\" class=\"wp-image-4222\" srcset=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/tmj-specialist-in-mumbai-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/tmj-specialist-in-mumbai-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/tmj-specialist-in-mumbai-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/tmj-specialist-in-mumbai.png 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dr. Dhivya Dilipkumar is one of the best TMJ specialists in India. She is a TMJ pain management specialist with more than 15 years of experience in the field. She is the co-founder of <a href=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/\">Dr. Dilip Dental Center<\/a>, where she practices and keeps high standards of patient care and innovative treatment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">She received her fellowship in TMJ\/TMD, orofacial, and sleep disorders from Roseman University in the USA. She completed her UG in dentistry from Dr. MGR Medical University in 2003 and her PG from Saveetha University in 2007. She later did her Lingual Orthodontics and Micro Implant Anchorage Systems from Kyungpook University in Korea.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Her clinic provides complete oral care and a holistic and innovative approach to all their treatment. They also have affordable insurance options for people looking to take their service but require financial assistance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Her areas of expertise:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>TMJ\/TMD Management<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Invisalign Treatment<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sleep Disorders<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Orthodontics<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lingual Orthodontics<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Micro Implant Anchorage System<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Contact Information:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dr. Dhivya Dilikumar is available for an online consultation. <strong>Book an online appointment<\/strong> right away to discuss your TMJ issues.<\/p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Which is better, online or physical consultation?<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While both approaches have their own benefits, it depends on a variety of factors and most importantly your comfort and preference that will decide which form of consultation will work best for you.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While in offline consultation, you have the liberty to meet the doctor in person, get your jaw assessed, conduct image tests, and have a complete offline evaluation done. This can also help you build