, and get all your TMJ-related queries sorted. And if you wish to seek a physical consultation, you can always reach out to her in her clinic in Chennai.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So Mumbai, get going towards a healthier and more comfortable lifestyle, right away!<\/p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">TMJ Specialist in Mumbai FAQs<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Who is the best TMJ specialist in Mumbai?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dr. Dhivya Dilipkumar is one of the best TMJ specialists for people in Mumbai. With the perfect mix of experience, innovation, and a holistic approach, she stands out as the best choice for any TMJ-related disorder.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>What qualifications should I look for in a TMJ specialist?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When searching for a TMJ specialist, it&#8217;s important to look for professionals who have specific training and experience in treating temporomandibular joint disorders.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Can TMJ disorders be treated without surgery?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yes, many TMJ disorders can be effectively managed or treated without resorting to surgery. Non-invasive treatments such as physical therapy, oral splints or mouthguards, stress management techniques, and medications to relieve pain and inflammation are often successful.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>How long does it typically take to see improvements with TMJ treatment?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The time frame for seeing improvements with TMJ treatment can vary widely depending on the severity of the condition, the specific treatment approach, and the individual&#8217;s response to treatment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Are TMJ treatments covered by insurance in India?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\